TEXT -2088 2080 Left 5 ;Transient Peak Current Mode Controller
TEXT -2360 2784 Left 4 ;* Voltage FB Err Amp Output used as peak current comparator trip point\n \n* When CLK pulses high and scaled Isns < EA_OUT setpoint, SET! -> Switch ON\n \n* When CLK low and scaled ISNS reaches EA_OUT setpoint, RESET! 0> Switch OFF\n \n* At DCM, instantaneous duty cycle ~ EA_OUT/(scaled Ipeak)\n \n* DCM Duty_Cycle(t) ~ (EA_OUT_SETPOINT*Lm)/(VIN*RSNS*Ts)\n \n* This is the large-signal, modulator model without slope compensation at DCM
